@ ShinyGold: moved from data/maps/KalmCityNousar_Interior3/text.inc (map removed)
KalmCityNousar_Interior3_Text_SageTroy::
	.string "It is not far to the ELDER.$"

@ ShinyGold: moved from data/maps/KalmCityNousar_Interior3/text.inc (map removed)
KalmCityNousar_Interior3_Text_SageLi_1::
	.string "So good of you to come here!\p"
	.string "SPROUT TOWER is a place of training.\p"
	.string "People and POKéMON test their bonds\n"
	.string "to build a brighter future together.\p"
	.string "I am the final test.\n"
	.string "Allow me to check the ties between\l"
	.string "your POkéMON and you!$"

@ ShinyGold: moved from data/maps/KalmCityNousar_Interior3/text.inc (map removed)
KalmCityNousar_Interior3_Text_SageLiDefeat::
	.string "Ah, excellent!$"

@ ShinyGold: moved from data/maps/KalmCityNousar_Interior3/text.inc (map removed)
KalmCityNousar_Interior3_Text_SageLiVictory::
	.string "Ah, how disappointing!$"

@ ShinyGold: moved from data/maps/KalmCityNousar_Interior3/text.inc (map removed)
KalmCityNousar_Interior3_Text_SageLi_2::
	.string "You and your POKéMON should have\n"
	.string "no problem using this move.\p"
	.string "Take this FLASH HM.$"

@ ShinyGold: moved from data/maps/KalmCityNousar_Interior3/text.inc (map removed)
KalmCityNousar_Interior3_Text_SageLi_3::
	.string "FLASH illuminates even the darkest\n"
	.string "of all places.\p"
	.string "But to use it out of battle, you\n"
	.string "need the BADGE from VIOLET’s GYM.$"

@ ShinyGold: moved from data/maps/KalmCityNousar_Interior3/text.inc (map removed)
KalmCityNousar_Interior3_Text_SageLi_4::
	.string "I hope you learn and grow from your\n"
	.string "journey.$"

@ ShinyGold: moved from data/maps/KalmCityNousar_Interior3/text.inc (map removed)
KalmCityNousar_Interior3_Text_Trigger6_1::
	.string "ELDER: You are indeed skilled as a\n"
	.string "trainer.\p"
	.string "As promised, here is your HM.\p"
	.string "But let me say this: You should\n"
	.string "treat your POKéMON better.\l"
	.string "The way you battle is far too harsh.\p"
	.string "POKéMON are not tools of war...$"

@ ShinyGold: moved from data/maps/KalmCityNousar_Interior3/text.inc (map removed)
KalmCityNousar_Interior3_Text_Trigger6_2::
	.string "...\n"
	.string "...Humph!\p"
	.string "He claims to be the ELDER but\n"
	.string "he’s weak.\p"
	.string "It stands to reason.\n"
	.string "I’d never lose to fools who babble\l"
	.string "about being nice to POKéMON.\p"
	.string "I only care about strong POKéMON\n"
	.string "that can win.\p"
	.string "I really couldn’t care less about\n"
	.string "weak POKéMON.$"

@ ShinyGold: moved from data/maps/KalmCityNousar_Interior3/text.inc (map removed)
KalmCityNousar_Interior3_Text_Trigger6_3::
	.string "{RIVAL} used ESCAPE ROPE.$"
